WEBVTT

00:00.140 --> 00:00.900
My name is Sebastian.

00:01.100 --> 00:03.000
I have a growth marketing agency and

00:03.040 --> 00:04.560
a podcast, so personal brand.

00:05.600 --> 00:07.620
And this weekend was amazing,

00:08.620 --> 00:10.840
mostly because I got exactly what I

00:10.940 --> 00:12.760
wanted, which was I wanted to feel

00:12.820 --> 00:15.040
empowered, not just to build something

00:15.100 --> 00:16.540
epic that I’m walking away with already,

00:16.640 --> 00:18.040
which I already did, which is sick.

00:18.740 --> 00:20.280
Uh, but I just wanted to feel empowered

00:20.340 --> 00:22.060
to have the tools and the know-how

00:22.100 --> 00:23.780
to keep building and taking this to

00:23.800 --> 00:24.500
the next level.

00:24.560 --> 00:26.880
So it’s definitely been worth every

00:26.920 --> 00:27.540
dollar.
